# alt_auto_takeoff.expect — ground mode change + ALT_HOLD auto-takeoff gates
# 地上モード変更＋ALT_HOLD 自動離陸のゲート
#
# Chain: mode change accepted while DISARMED on the ground (BEFORE "ARM accepted")
# → armed in ALT_HOLD with props stopped (duty ≈ 0 in the armed-ground window)
# → throttle-up engages the auto-takeoff → airborne detection completes it →
# ALT_HOLD holds the captured altitude (normal G2/G3/G4 gates).
# 連鎖: 地上 DISARM 中のモード変更受理（"ARM accepted" より前）→ ALT_HOLD で ARM
# してもプロペラ停止（armed-ground 窓で duty ≈ 0）→ スロットル上げで自動離陸 →
# 空中検知で完了 → ALT_HOLD が捕捉高度を保持（通常の G2/G3/G4 ゲート）。
exit 0
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD"
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
order "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD" "ARM accepted"
order "ARM accepted" "Auto-takeoff engaged"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
metric duty_max < 0.05 in 7.8 8.4
metric alt_rmse < 0.08 in 11.5 16.0
metric alt_band < 0.35 in 11.5 16.0
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 11.5 16.0
metric tilt_max < 10.0 in 8.5 16.0
